OL,3,ASenior US soldier arrested by UK
OL,4,Acounter-terror police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA soldier in the US Army has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of offences under
OL,8,Fthe National Security Act which relate
OL,9,Fto Russia, British counter-terror
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FThe 41-year-old senior serviceman was
OL,13,Farrested near Gloucester on Tuesday.
OL,15,FIn a statement, Counter Terrorism
OL,16,FPolicing London said the man had been
OL,17,Farrested under section one and section
OL,18,Fthree of the National Security Act
OL,19,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
